		{
			id: "41FB99370D73710A"
			icon: "minecraft:iron_sword"
			title: "Paid to Fight"
			subtitle: "Where money comes from here"
			description: [
				"Every hostile mob you kill pays you &6one coin&r, and killing is where most of your"
				"money will come from. There is no ore to sell and no crop to grind. Twenty-five"
				"zombies will do for a start."
				""
				"Spend them with &6/shop&r, which sells food, colony parts, tools, pets and Alex's"
				"Caves maps, and buys surplus on its Sell tab. The &6Market&r beside it lists your"
				"own goods for other players at a price you set. &6Easy Villagers&r, which the rest"
				"of this page covers, gives you trades you own outright and can automate, with"
				"nobody else online."
				""
				"&7Kills are counted per player, so everyone in a party is paid for the same fight.&r"
			]
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{
				id: "75E3E2BF815EB881"
